                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Data files for the research project Geopolitics of Artivism (ISBN: 978-90-361-0641-2). This dataset contains the following files:<br><div>- tweets_final.txt: all tweets that mention Banksy, Ai Weiwei, Jafar Panahi, Jonas Staal, Hans Haacke or Pussy Riot from the period 2010-2015.</div><div>- news_articles_final.xlsx: newspaper articles that mention Banksy, Ai Weiwei, Jafar Panahi, Jonas Staal, Hans Haacke or Pussy Riot from the period 2010-2015 from both quality and popular newspapers from the US, UK and Netherlands.</div><div>- interview_data.txt: interview data of those interview candidates who consented to sharing their data with third parties.</div><div>- tweets_cleaning_code.txt: Python code used to clean and process raw data.</div><div>- newspaper_cleaning_code.txt: Python code used to clean and process raw data.</div><div>- readme.txt: the readme file with further information and instructions.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
                }
              }
            ]
